605	     * date. A registration may be back-dated but never post-dated. The check is made against the
606	     * value as supplied, before any defaulting or business-day roll (see
607	     * {@link #defaultRegistrationDate}); a {@code null} registration date is accepted (it defaults
608	     * to the server date).
