756	     * {@link org.springframework.samples.petclinic.model.Owner#getMembershipLevel()}. A new owner
757	     * joining an existing household without declaring it (i.e. admitted via its {@code email}, not
758	     * via {@code sharesHousehold}) may not hold a membership level more than one above the current
759	     * maximum membership level among the existing members of its household: the cap is that maximum
760	     * plus one. When the household has no existing member no cap applies, and a declared member
761	     * (one that opted in via {@code sharesHousehold}) is never capped; in both cases the cap is left
762	     * unset so the points-derived level stands. The scan is taken over the existing owners before
763	     * this one is persisted, so it reflects only pre-existing household members.
